## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design scalable, compliant flag systems across regions with strict latency.

## Key Concepts
- Azure API Management, Functions, Cosmos DB per-tenant partitioning
- Redis caching and cache invalidation
- Canary rollouts, versioning, Event Grid
- Observability and failure handling

## Code Example
```javascript
// Flag evaluation sketch
async function getFlag(tenantId, flagName) {
  const cacheKey = `${tenantId}:${flagName}`;
  let value = await redis.get(cacheKey);
  if (value != null) return JSON.parse(value);
  const flagDoc = await cosmos.Flags.findOne({ tenantId, flagName });
  value = flagDoc?.value ?? false;
  await redis.set(cacheKey, JSON.stringify(value), { ttl: 60 });
  return value;
}
```

